324|/***
325| * MARK: resolveTimelineStageLabel
326| * @description Maps a timeline stage label to a human-readable stage name for
327| *   display. Stage ids are positional numbers that can change when the
328| *   workflow is edited, so legacy timeline entries that recorded a bare
329| *   numeric id are mapped (best-effort) onto the current stage with that id.
330| *   Labels that are already human-readable names, or numeric labels that match
331| *   no current stage, are returned unchanged.
332| * @example resolveTimelineStageLabel('1', [{ id: '1', name: 'Idea' }]) => 'Idea'
